      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Telegram Lead Capture & Consultation Booking Bot (V1)\n**Before activating:**\n1. Create the Google Sheet *Telegram Lead Capture CRM* with tabs **Leads** and **Sessions** (exact headers from the guide). Format the Phone and Telegram User ID columns as *Plain text*.\n2. Open the **Config** node and paste your Spreadsheet ID and the owner's Telegram chat ID.\n3. Attach your Telegram credential to the trigger and every Telegram node.\n4. Attach your Google Sheets credential to every Google Sheets node.\n5. Owner must press *Start* on the bot once, otherwise Telegram blocks the owner notification.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
